Debug mode highlights each of the four declarators of one `declare const` statement: the first from `declare` through its name, the others by their bare names, leaving every type annotation plain.
== args
--debug
input/declare-const-many.ts
== file input/declare-const-many.ts
declare const w: number, x: string, y: boolean, z: object;
== stdout
«declare const w»: number, «x»: string, «y»: boolean, «z»: object;
